      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Throw a <a href=\"PortInUseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server\"><code>PortInUseException</code></a> if the given exception was caused by a \"port in\nuse\" <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/BindException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>BindException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果给定的异常是由“端口被占用”<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/BindException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>BindException</code></a> 引起的，则抛出 <a href=\"PortInUseException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server\"><code>PortInUseException</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>port</code> - the port that was in use",
