      "translation": "<code>action</code> - 要执行的操作",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Perform an action if the given exception was caused by a \"port in use\"\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/BindException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>BindException</code></a>.",
